                {
                  "id": "lede",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "When margins get tight, the right trailer choice can move your numbers in the right direction. Fleet managers and owner-operators across Florida look for Hyundai trailers for sale because Hyundai Translead consistently delivers what matters most: lighter builds, durable construction, and a lower total cost of ownership (TCO). Lighter equipment helps you carry more payload with less fuel, while high-quality components reduce downtime and surprise repairs. That combination is how you protect cash flow and keep loads moving.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full",
                    "anchor": "post-lede"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-gains",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "What Florida Fleets Gain with Hyundai Translead",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "gains"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-gains-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Hyundai Translead has become a go-to for fleets that measure performance over years, not weeks. Here's why:",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "cards-gains-2",
                  "type": "card-lists",
                  "props": {
                    "variant": "type",
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "title": "Weight Efficiency that Pays Off",
                        "points": [],
                        "intro": "Reducing vehicle weight is one of the most reliable ways to improve fuel economy. A meaningful reduction in trailer weight can translate to a real improvement in fuel economy over time, which adds up across a fleet."
                      },
                      {
                        "title": "Smart Durability",
                        "points": [],
                        "intro": "Hyundai's dry van families (HY-Cube, Composite, Composite XT) are engineered for longevity with corrosion-resistant materials and reinforced structures that stand up to Florida's heat, salt-air corridors, and high-utilization routes."
                      },
                      {
                        "title": "Serviceability that Reduces Downtime",
                        "points": [],
                        "intro": "Composite sidewalls and repair-friendly designs make panel replacements and routine fixes faster, so trailers return to service quickly."
                      },
                      {
                        "title": "Lifecycle Value",
                        "points": [],
                        "intro": "When operating costs are at record highs, choosing spec-driven trailers that lower fuel and maintenance expenses is a practical TCO choice, not a luxury."
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-gains-3",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "The initial purchase price of new equipment is an important factor to consider, but these specs factor into your total cost of ownership over your trailer's lifetime. Hyundai Translead's dedication to quality means a better ROI and lower TCO for your equipment.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-models",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Model Options Built for Work (and Weather)",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "models"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-models-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Whether you're hauling dry freight across I-4 or making Gulf Coast runs, Sun State Trailers can help you match the spec to the job.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "cards-models-2",
                  "type": "card-lists",
                  "props": {
                    "variant": "type3",
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "title": "Dry Vans",
                        "points": [
                          {
                            "text": "Built for a longer service life, resisting dock impacts and daily wear"
                          },
                          {
                            "text": "Efficient interior dimensions and floor ratings for dense freight"
                          },
                          {
                            "text": "Anti-corrosion hot-dipped galvanization for humid, coastal environments"
                          }
                        ],
                        "intro": "HY-Cube, Composite, Composite XT"
                      },
                      {
                        "title": "Refrigerated",
                        "points": [
                          {
                            "text": "Light and durable with a bonded roof and in-house galvanization"
                          },
                          {
                            "text": "Customizable options to fit your business needs"
                          },
                          {
                            "text": "Insulation designed for consistent cold chain performance"
                          }
                        ],
                        "intro": "ThermoTech"
